#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Welcome to your dashboard"
msgstr "欢迎使用你的控制台"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Everything lives in the navigation on the left (at the bottom on a phone). Here is what each tab is for."
msgstr "所有功能都在左侧导航栏中（手机上位于底部）。以下是各个标签页的用途。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Today's calls, your plan and shortcuts."
msgstr "今日调用、你的套餐和快捷方式。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Keys, connected apps, and the Telegram and WhatsApp bots."
msgstr "密钥、已连接的应用，以及 Telegram 和 WhatsApp 机器人。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Calls per day, by client and your credit history."
msgstr "每日调用量、按客户端统计及你的额度记录。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Every tool and the data behind it."
msgstr "所有工具及其背后的数据。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Which DATA.GOV.HK datasets are converted next."
msgstr "接下来要转换哪些 DATA.GOV.HK 数据集。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Ask about live data, or ask it to do things in the dashboard for you."
msgstr "查询实时数据，或让它在控制台中替你操作。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Your plan and allowance."
msgstr "你的套餐和额度。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Connect your chat client"
msgstr "连接你的聊天客户端"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Add mcprouter to the chat app you already use, such as Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, Gemini CLI, Codex or Cursor. Pick your client under Connected apps and follow its steps; most sign in with OAuth, so there is no key to copy."
msgstr "将 mcprouter 添加到你正在使用的聊天应用，例如 Claude、ChatGPT、Gemini、Gemini CLI、Codex 或 Cursor。在“已连接的应用”中选择你的客户端并按步骤操作；大多数客户端通过 OAuth 登录，无需复制密钥。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Set up a client"
msgstr "设置客户端"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Quick start: ask the agent"
msgstr "快速开始：向智能体提问"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "No setup needed: the Agent tab answers with live data, starting with Hong Kong: the weather, the next bus or A&E waiting times. It can also find pages and prepare actions here, such as creating a key."
msgstr "无需设置：“智能体”标签页会用实时数据回答你，从香港开始：天气、下一班巴士或急诊等候时间。它还能在这里查找页面并准备操作，例如创建密钥。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Try “What's the weather now?”"
msgstr "试试“现在天气怎么样？”"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "New: chat with ChatGPT, Gemini and Claude"
msgstr "新功能：在 ChatGPT、Gemini 和 Claude 中聊天"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "mcprouter now works in ChatGPT, Gemini and Claude. Connect it once and ask about live data, starting with Hong Kong's weather and transport, right in the chat app you already use."
msgstr "mcprouter 现已支持 ChatGPT、Gemini 和 Claude。只需连接一次，即可在你正在使用的聊天应用中查询实时数据，从香港的天气和交通开始。"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Connect a client"
msgstr "连接客户端"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "New: the agent on Telegram and WhatsApp"
msgstr "新功能：在 Telegram 和 WhatsApp 上使用智能体"

#: lib/intro-cards.ts
msgid "Chat with the mcprouter agent from Telegram or WhatsApp. Link your account once, then send a message like you would to a friend. Calls count towards your plan."
msgstr "在 Telegram 或 WhatsApp 上与 mcprouter 智能体聊天。关联一次账户后，就像给朋友发消息一样提问。调用会计入你的套餐。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Terminal"
msgstr "终端"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Add mcprouter as a remote HTTP server."
msgstr "将 mcprouter 添加为远程 HTTP 服务器。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Start Claude Code, run /mcp, choose mcprouter and pick Authenticate. Sign in and approve access in the browser that opens."
msgstr "启动 Claude Code，运行 /mcp，选择 mcprouter 并点击 Authenticate。在打开的浏览器中登录并授权访问。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Add the server with your key in the Authorization header."
msgstr "添加服务器，并在 Authorization 请求头中填入你的密钥。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Run /mcp in Claude Code to check that mcprouter is connected."
msgstr "在 Claude Code 中运行 /mcp，确认 mcprouter 已连接。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Add --scope user to use mcprouter in every project, or --scope project to share it through .mcp.json."
msgstr "添加 --scope user 可在所有项目中使用 mcprouter，或使用 --scope project 通过 .mcp.json 共享。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "claude.ai, Desktop and mobile"
msgstr "claude.ai、桌面版和移动版"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "In Claude, open Settings → Connectors and choose Add custom connector."
msgstr "在 Claude 中打开“Settings → Connectors”，选择“Add custom connector”。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Name it mcprouter and paste the server URL."
msgstr "将其命名为 mcprouter，并粘贴服务器 URL。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Choose Add, then Connect. Sign in to mcprouter and approve access."
msgstr "选择“Add”，然后选择“Connect”。登录 mcprouter 并授权访问。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "In a chat, open the tools menu and turn on mcprouter. Connectors added on the web also appear in Claude Desktop and the mobile apps."
msgstr "在对话中打开工具菜单并启用 mcprouter。在网页版添加的连接器也会出现在 Claude 桌面版和移动应用中。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "On Team and Enterprise plans, an owner adds the connector under Admin settings → Connectors first. Each member then connects it themselves."
msgstr "在 Team 和 Enterprise 套餐中，需先由所有者在“Admin settings → Connectors”中添加连接器，然后每位成员再自行连接。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "In ChatGPT, open Settings → Security and login and turn on Developer mode."
msgstr "在 ChatGPT 中打开“Settings → Security and login”，开启“Developer mode”。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "On the Plugins page, choose Add → Create MCP App. Name it mcprouter, keep Server URL selected under Connection and paste the MCP server URL."
msgstr "在 Plugins 页面选择“Add → Create MCP App”。将其命名为 mcprouter，在 Connection 下保持选中“Server URL”，并粘贴 MCP 服务器 URL。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Open ChatGPT Plugins"
msgstr "打开 ChatGPT Plugins"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Leave Authentication on OAuth, tick the acknowledgement, then choose Create. Sign in to mcprouter and approve access."
msgstr "Authentication 保持为 OAuth，勾选确认项，然后选择“Create”。登录 mcprouter 并授权访问。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "In a chat, type @ or open the tools menu and pick mcprouter."
msgstr "在对话中输入 @ 或打开工具菜单，然后选择 mcprouter。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Developer mode is available on Plus and Pro, and on Business, Enterprise and Edu plans where an admin allows it."
msgstr "Developer mode 适用于 Plus 和 Pro 套餐；Business、Enterprise 和 Edu 套餐需经管理员允许。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "In Gemini on the web, open Settings → Connected Apps. Under Custom apps, choose Add a custom app and paste the MCP server URL."
msgstr "在网页版 Gemini 中，打开“Settings → Connected Apps”。在“Custom apps”下选择“Add a custom app”，然后粘贴 MCP 服务器 URL。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Open Gemini Connected Apps"
msgstr "打开 Gemini Connected Apps"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Choose Next. Leave Advanced features closed, as mcprouter registers itself. Sign in to mcprouter and approve access."
msgstr "选择“Next”。“Advanced features”保持收起即可，mcprouter 会自行注册。登录 mcprouter 并批准访问。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "In a chat, type @ and pick mcprouter. Once added on the web, it also works in the Gemini mobile app."
msgstr "在对话中输入 @ 并选择 mcprouter。在网页版添加后，Gemini 手机应用中也能使用。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Custom apps need a personal Google Account (not work or school), Keep Activity turned on, and are available in English to people 18 or over in the US."
msgstr "Custom apps 需要个人 Google 账户（非工作或学校账户）并开启 Keep Activity，目前仅向美国 18 岁或以上的用户提供英文版本。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "CLI and IDE extension"
msgstr "CLI 和 IDE 扩展"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Add mcprouter as a streamable HTTP server."
msgstr "将 mcprouter 添加为 Streamable HTTP 服务器。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Sign in. Codex opens your browser to approve access."
msgstr "登录。Codex 会打开浏览器让你授权访问。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Run /mcp in Codex to check that mcprouter's tools are listed."
msgstr "在 Codex 中运行 /mcp，确认已列出 mcprouter 的工具。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Export your key. Add it to your shell profile so new terminals have it too."
msgstr "导出你的密钥。将其添加到 shell 配置文件中，以便新终端也能使用。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Add the server to ~/.codex/config.toml. Codex sends the variable as a Bearer token."
msgstr "将服务器添加到 ~/.codex/config.toml。Codex 会将该变量作为 Bearer 令牌发送。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "The CLI and the Codex IDE extension share ~/.codex/config.toml, so one setup covers both."
msgstr "CLI 与 Codex IDE 扩展共用 ~/.codex/config.toml，配置一次即可同时适用。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Add mcprouter as an HTTP server."
msgstr "将 mcprouter 添加为 HTTP 服务器。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Start Gemini CLI and sign in. Your browser opens to approve access."
msgstr "启动 Gemini CLI 并登录。浏览器会打开以授权访问。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Run /mcp to check that mcprouter's tools are listed."
msgstr "运行 /mcp，确认已列出 mcprouter 的工具。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Or add it to ~/.gemini/settings.json yourself."
msgstr "或者自行将其添加到 ~/.gemini/settings.json。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Add --scope user to use mcprouter in every folder. Without it the server is saved to the project's .gemini/settings.json."
msgstr "添加 --scope user 可在所有文件夹中使用 mcprouter。否则服务器将保存到项目的 .gemini/settings.json 中。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Editor"
msgstr "编辑器"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Add mcprouter to ~/.cursor/mcp.json."
msgstr "将 mcprouter 添加到 ~/.cursor/mcp.json。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Open Cursor Settings → MCP, find mcprouter and choose Connect. Sign in and approve access."
msgstr "打开“Cursor Settings → MCP”，找到 mcprouter 并选择“Connect”。登录并授权访问。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Add mcprouter to ~/.cursor/mcp.json with your key."
msgstr "将 mcprouter 连同你的密钥添加到 ~/.cursor/mcp.json。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Other clients"
msgstr "其他客户端"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Any MCP client"
msgstr "任意 MCP 客户端"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Point the client at the Streamable HTTP endpoint. Clients that support MCP authorization find sign-in on their own."
msgstr "将客户端指向 Streamable HTTP 端点。支持 MCP 授权的客户端会自动发现登录方式。"

#: lib/mcp-clients.ts
msgid "Send the key as a Bearer token. Clients that only speak stdio can go through mcp-remote."
msgstr "将密钥作为 Bearer 令牌发送。仅支持 stdio 的客户端可通过 mcp-remote 连接。"

